# T-152-015 Execution Plan — Dashboard Audit

## Scope
READ-ONLY audit. Report file only:
- docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-015-dashboard-audit.md

## Steps
1. Enumerate src/dashboard/src/pages/*.tsx — verify 7 pages (Dashboard, Directives, Memory, Debt, Tasks, Agents, Chat)
2. Inspect src/api/server.ts — find /api/events SSE endpoint, event stream plumbing, Sprint 150 T-003 wiring
3. Inspect src/dashboard/src/i18n.ts + locales/tr.json + locales/en.json — verify TR/EN toggle
